    "text": "Netflix Ends $100M Deal With Meghan Markle and Prince Harry, But ‘More Projects Coming’ as Duo Pivots to Lifestyle Brand\nBy Betty Tzeng,\n6 hours agoMeghan Markle and Prince Harry's headline-making $100 million content deal with Netflix will officially conclude this fall without renewal, according to sources familiar with the matter. The 2020 agreement, struck at the height of the couple's post-royal rebranding, will transition into a non-exclusive, first-look arrangement as both parties shift their strategies.",
